license: MIT
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-10-19"
abstract: >-
  proof-studio authors forged-proof attack scenarios (tampered artifact hash,
  forged signature, replayed packet), runs them against the real rigforge
  verifier, and reports per attack class what gets caught. Planted-failure
  vectors are committed and CI fails when a forgery stops going red.
keywords:
  - tamper-evidence
  - proof-packets
  - benchmark
  - verification
  - ai-agents
